       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPTR06B.
      * BENEFICIARY INTEREST TEST FOR TRUST CUSTOMERS
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MIN-INTEREST           PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 15.00.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-INTEREST-PCT           PIC 9(3)V99.
       01  LK-IDENTIFY               PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-INTEREST-PCT LK-IDENTIFY.
       1000-TEST.
           IF LK-INTEREST-PCT >= WS-MIN-INTEREST
              MOVE 'Y' TO LK-IDENTIFY
           ELSE
              MOVE 'N' TO LK-IDENTIFY
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
